<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean, products basis levels for June 20.</p>
<p>(NS - no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount, NB - no bidder)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		35/25  D     June	    30/20  D</p>
<p> July		30/20  D     July	    20/15  D</p>
<p> August	    25/40  P     August	  20/30  P</p>
<p> Sept		90/120 P     Sept	    90/110 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		30/28   D	June	    33/30   D</p>
<p> July		29/28   D	July	    30/28.5 D</p>
<p> August	    12/10   D	August	11.5/10   D</p>
<p> Sept		 2/6    P	Sept	     2/4    P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	 BASIS	   MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		40/60 P	 June	    40/55 P</p>
<p> July		40/60 P	 July	    40/55 P</p>
<p> August	    35/50 P	 August	  35/45 P</p>
<p> Sept		30/40 P	 Sept	    30/40 P</p>
